From 81a4102839b0dc2bf4ca804359560a296e97a9af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:28:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/65] Draw text: port UI_DrawText and the blitter text
 renderer

Ports H030+$0256 UI_DrawText, H030+$019A (fill text cells), H008+$139E,
the H038 RectFill/pen adapters and H049+$0224 Draw_TextWithBlitter with
Draw_GlyphRowsCPU. The renderer programs the blitter registers directly,
as the original does: custom.h writes $DFF000 on the Amiga, and on the
host host/blitter.c emulates area-mode blits (minterms, A/B shifts,
first/last word masks, modulos, descending mode). The loading message
now appears in the gothic font.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
